<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 586.48, off 1.87.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 298 to 264.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.02.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 24,340,825 compared with 28,487,440 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
